><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7yzs0sinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7yzs0sinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mt7yzs0v2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7yzs0v2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:48px;"><span style="color:#FBFBFB;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">About ATL &amp; Our Team</span></h1></div><div id="comp-mt7yzs0w6" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7yzs0w6 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h6 class="font_6 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#FBFBFB;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">For more than 20 years, ATL has grown from Automated Technologies Limited into one of Canterbury&#39;s leading providers of electrical, HVAC and smart technology solutions. Meet the team, explore our story and discover what makes ATL different.</span></span></h6></div><div id="comp-mt7yzs0z4" class="comp-mt7yzs0z4 wixui-vector-image"><div data-testid="svgRoot-comp-mt7yzs0z4" class="iL7Pq5 gx51wo">
<svg preserveAspectRatio="none" data-bbox="97.73 0 938.34 551.397" viewBox="97.73 0 938.34 551.397" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-type="shape" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="">
