</div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section id="comp-mt7z4sd8" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mt7z4sd8 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mt7z4sd8" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mt7z4sd8" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mt7z4sd8" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mt7z4sd8" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7z4sd8inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7z4sd8inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mt7z4sdj1" class="ih2JY1 comp-mt7z4sdj1 wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="BprtEa"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="979px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_37eeee67ab2f4583881d5ce2d2f83d9c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_605,w_5568,h_2502/fill/w_979,h_440,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/team%20photo.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_37eeee67ab2f4583881d5ce2d2f83d9c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_605,w_5568,h_2502/fill/w_1958,h_880,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/team%20photo.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-mt7z4sdj1" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_37eeee67ab2f4583881d5ce2d2f83d9c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_0,y_605,w_5568,h_2502/fill/w_979,h_440,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/team%20photo.jpg" alt="ATL Electrical team outside the Christchurch showroom" style="object-fit:cover" class="klqGPG sFiSiq" width="979" height="440"/></div></div></div></div></section><section id="comp-mt7z698r" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mt7z698r wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mt7z698r" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mt7z698r" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mt7z698r" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mt7z698r" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7z698rinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7z698rinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mt7z6999" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7z6999 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:36px;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed; font-size:36px; font-style:normal; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.05em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Our story</span></h2></div><div id="comp-mt7z699c1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7z699c1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:24px;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family:montserrat; font-size:24px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:0em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Established in 2007</span></h3></div><div id="comp-mt7z699d" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7z699d wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">ATL began as Automated Technologies Limited, a name that reflected our passion for innovation and smarter technology solutions. As the business has grown, so too has our expertise. What started with a focus on electrical and automation has evolved into one of Canterbury&#39;s leading providers of electrical, HVAC, security, sustainable energy and smart technology solutions for residential, commercial and industrial clients.</p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Proudly locally owned and based in <span class="color_42 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.atlelectrical.co.nz/christchurch" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Christchurch</a></span></span>, ATL has built its reputation on delivering quality workmanship, trusted advice and long-term customer relationships. Today, our experienced team of 38 supports residential, commercial and industrial customers with design, installation, servicing, maintenance and ongoing support across a wide range of specialist services.</p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">As part of our continued growth, we&#39;re proud to have welcomed the experienced team from Greg Topp Betta Electrical in <span class="color_42 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><a href="https://www.atlelectrical.co.nz/reefton" target="_self" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Reefton </a></span></span>to the ATL family. This expansion has strengthened our presence in the Buller District on the West Coast, allowing us to provide the same high standard of service and local expertise to even more homes, businesses and industrial clients throughout the region.</p></div><div id="comp-mt7z699e2" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7z699e2 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h3 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; font-size:24px;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family:montserrat; font-size:24px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:0em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Committed to quality &amp; safety</span></h3></div><div id="comp-mt7z699f1" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7z699f1 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Safety is at the core of everything we do. ATL maintains current SiteWise accreditation, and our team of technicians and certified Master Electricians work to the latest industry standards and best practices. Ongoing training is a key part of our culture, with regular first aid training, manufacturer certifications and professional development ensuring our team stays up to date with evolving technologies, products and installation methods.</p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Whether we&#39;re completing a small residential service call or delivering a large commercial project, our commitment remains the same&mdash;providing safe, reliable and future-ready solutions backed by exceptional customer service.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="comp-mtumuiko" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mtumuiko wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mtumuiko" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mtumuiko" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mtumuiko" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mtumuiko" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mtumuikoinlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mtumuikoinlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mtuu4zo01" class="QrIus  comp-mtuu4zo01"><div class="comp-mtuu4zo01"><style>.comp-mtuu4zo01 {
