ze:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">20+ Years Experience</span></span><span class="color_42 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; |&nbsp; </span></span><span class="color_36 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Qualified Specialists</span></span><span class="color_42 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; |&nbsp; </span></span><span class="color_36 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Residential &bull; Commercial &bull; Industrial</span></span><span class="color_42 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp; |</span></span><span class="color_42 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span class="color_36 wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Control4 Certified Showroom</span></span></span></span></h4></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><section id="comp-mt7zmq50" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mt7zmq50 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mt7zmq50" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mt7zmq50" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mt7zmq50" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mt7zmq50" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7zmq50inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mt7zmq50inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mt7zmko7" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7zmko7 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text" style="line-height:normal; text-align:center; font-size:36px;"><span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family:tusker-grotesk-condensed; font-size:36px; font-style:normal; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:0.05em;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Trusted, certified and committed to excellence</span></h2></div><div id="comp-mt7zmko8" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mt7zmko8 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="text-align:center; font-size:18px;">​Our team is committed to maintaining the highest professional standards through recognised industry accreditations, manufacturer training and ongoing certification. These qualifications demonstrate our commitment to quality workmanship, safety and staying at the forefront of evolving technologies.</p></div><div id="comp-mt7zos7z" class="W4V2qg comp-mt7zos7z wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="111px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_c1cedde2a1f44f93b140f968fad5549f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_111,h_51,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1c9d7c_c1cedde2a1f44f93b140f968fad5549f~mv2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_c1cedde2a1f44f93b140f968fad5549f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_222,h_102,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1c9d7c_c1cedde2a1f44f93b140f968fad5549f~mv2.jpg 2x" id="img_comp-mt7zos7z" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_c1cedde2a1f44f93b140f968fad5549f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_111,h_51,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1c9d7c_c1cedde2a1f44f93b140f968fad5549f~mv2.jpg" alt="Master Electrcians Member badge" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="111" height="51"/></div></div><div id="comp-mt7zos7q" class="W4V2qg comp-mt7zos7q wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="145px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1c9d7c_091e90c72620485eb8b778b0eb8dd273~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_145,h_47,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/1c9d7c_091e90c72620485eb8b778b0eb8dd273~mv2.jpg 1x, https://static.wixstatic.co